Sval: move Firefox's translations button out of the address field

Sval's site controls draw the button under its id and its parts' ids
(SvalHeader), so FullPageTranslationsPanel shows, marks and anchors on
that copy, and the toolbox's click and keypress handlers open the panel
from it.

